<title>USA: Inverness Wtr &amp; Sani Dist, Colo., yields 5.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Inverness Wtr &amp; Sani Dist, Colo., yields 5.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said it priced $6 million of Inverness Water and Sanitary Dist., Colo., with a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2015.</p>
</text>
